   "text": "day/start: score the day, flag the top 20%\norder/deliver · otp/send · otp/verify: the OTP round trip, ₹15 credited\norder/attempt: attempted + WhatsApp \"did the rider reach you?\" check\norder/refuse: refusal OTP, parcel goes to the Refused-Parcel Desk\ndesk/act: second chance · match → new AWB · consolidate\nwhatsapp/inbound: Twilio webhook, X-Twilio-Signature verified\nadmin/reset: token required\n\nRuns the same engine code. Every input validated (zod). OTPs hashed, 10-minute expiry, 5 tries, rate-limited per order. The service\nkey never reaches the browser.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "day/start: score the day, flag the top 20%\norder/deliver · otp/send · otp/verify: the OTP round trip, ₹15 credited\norder/attempt: attempted + WhatsApp \"did the rider reach you?\" check\norder/refuse: refusal OTP, parcel goes to the Refused-Parcel Desk\ndesk/act: second chance · match → new AWB · consolidate\nwhatsapp/inbound: Twilio webhook, X-Twilio-Signature verified\nadmin/reset: token required\n\nRuns the same engine code. Every input validated (zod). OTPs hashed, 10-minute expiry, 5 tries, rate-limited per order. The service\nkey never reaches the browser.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
