   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "REAL: pincodes, road distances, the case numbers, WhatsApp messages, OTPs, live sync across devices, the decision code.   SIMULATED and labelled on every screen: orders, riders, refused parcels, pilot outcomes, and the TrustMesh part of the Rescue Score (a\nstand-in).",
